laky server.\n`WeatherClient.get` in `weather.py` now retries on HTTP 503, up to 3 attempts in total. The wait between attempts doubles each time: 0.5s, then 1s. After the third 503 it raises the `HTTPError`.\n\nOther errors (a 500, timeouts, connection failures) are not retried. A non-503 status raises on the first attempt.\n\nI added `attempts=3` and `backoff=0.5` as constructor parameters so the defaults can be changed.\n\nI checked it against a local test server:\n\n| Server behavior | Result |\n|---|---|\n| 503 twice, then 200 | Succeeds on the 3rd request |\n| 503 three times | Raises 503 after 3 requests |\n| 503 five times | Raises 503 after 3 requests |\n| 500 once | Raises 500 after 1 request |\n\nI didn't add a test file to the repo; that check was a one-off script.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 1, "replies_ok": 5, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 34969, "requests_cache_write": 142880, "requests_cost_usd": 0.3751609, "requests_count": 5, "requests_input_uncached": 12, "requests_output": 1444, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial2", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 62, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-18T00:42:45.189342+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 18.056, "t_checker_s": 2.379, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-omp-netclient", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "off", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1456, "tokens_cache_read": 34969, "tokens_cache_write": 142880, "tokens_fresh": 1456, "tokens_input_uncached": 12, "tokens_main_cache_read": 34969, "tokens_main_cache_write": 142880, "tokens_main_c